<title>PAKISTAN: PAKISTAN JULY WHOLESALE PRICES AT 10.67 YR/YR.</title>
<headline>PAKISTAN JULY WHOLESALE PRICES AT 10.67 YR/YR.</headline>
<dateline>ISLAMABAD 1997-08-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Pakistan's wholesale price index rose 10.67 percent in July year-on-year compared to 12.05 percent in June, the Federal Bureau of Statistics said on Wednesday.  </p>
<p>The index, using 1990/91 as base year, rose 0.33 percent to 208.45 from 207.76 in June. The index stood at 188.36 in July 1996.</p>
<p>					  July     June	 July 1996</p>
<p>WHOLESALE PRICES base 1990/91   208.45   207.76     188.36</p>
<p>    Month-on-month		   0.33    -0.41	  n/a</p>
<p>    Year-on-year		   +10.67   +12.05	  n/a</p>
<p>-- Islamabad Newsroom (9251) 274757; Fax 274759</p>
